WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.263
Back and hips flat on the pad, feet shoulder-width on the platform.

2
00:00:02.263 --> 00:00:04.527
Lower the platform until your knees bend to 90 degrees.

3
00:00:04.527 --> 00:00:06.790
Push through your whole foot until your legs are straight, knees soft.
